{"seq":3,"slug":"ai-application-scenarios","title":"AI 应用场景","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/digital-economy/data-analytics-applications/ai-application-scenarios","wordCount":1832,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"ai-应用场景\">AI 应用场景</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>人工智能在数字经济中的角色正从&quot;锦上添花的实验技术&quot;转变为&quot;不可或缺的生产力工具&quot;。推荐系统决定了电商平台的流量分配效率，NLP 驱动的智能客服处理了 70% 以上的用户咨询，AIGC 将内容生产的成本降低了一个数量级。理解这些 AI 应用的原理与边界，是数字经济从业者必备的技术素养。</p>\n<h3 id=\"机器学习在商业中的应用图谱\">机器学习在商业中的应用图谱</h3><p>机器学习解决的核心商业问题可归纳为四类：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    ML[&quot;机器学习商业应用&quot;] --&gt; Pred[&quot;预测型&quot;]&#10;    ML --&gt; Disc[&quot;发现型&quot;]&#10;    ML --&gt; Auto[&quot;自动化型&quot;]&#10;    ML --&gt; Gen[&quot;生成型&quot;]&#10;    Pred --&gt; P1[&quot;需求预测/销量预估&quot;]&#10;    Pred --&gt; P2[&quot;用户流失预警&quot;]&#10;    Disc --&gt; D1[&quot;用户分群/聚类&quot;]&#10;    Disc --&gt; D2[&quot;异常检测/欺诈识别&quot;]&#10;    Auto --&gt; A1[&quot;推荐系统&quot;]&#10;    Auto --&gt; A2[&quot;智能定价&quot;]&#10;    Gen --&gt; G1[&quot;文案生成&quot;]&#10;    Gen --&gt; G2[&quot;图片/视频创作&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    ML[\"机器学习商业应用\"] --&gt; Pred[\"预测型\"]\n    ML --&gt; Disc[\"发现型\"]\n    ML --&gt; Auto[\"自动化型\"]\n    ML --&gt; Gen[\"生成型\"]\n    Pred --&gt; P1[\"需求预测/销量预估\"]\n    Pred --&gt; P2[\"用户流失预警\"]\n    Disc --&gt; D1[\"用户分群/聚类\"]\n    Disc --&gt; D2[\"异常检测/欺诈识别\"]\n    Auto --&gt; A1[\"推荐系统\"]\n    Auto --&gt; A2[\"智能定价\"]\n    Gen --&gt; G1[\"文案生成\"]\n    Gen --&gt; G2[\"图片/视频创作\"]</pre><p>机器学习模型在业务中的价值量化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>业务价值</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>指标</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>指标货币化系数</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>模型部署成本</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{业务价值} = \\Delta \\text{指标} \\times \\text{指标货币化系数} - \\text{模型部署成本}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">业务价值</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">指标</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">指标货币化系数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">模型部署成本</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>例如推荐系统将点击率提升 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2%</span></span></span></span></span>，每次点击的商业价值为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 元，日展示量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 次：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>日增量收入</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>0.02</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mtext>万元/天</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{日增量收入} = 10^8 \\times 0.02 \\times 0.5 = 100\\text{万元/天}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">日增量收入</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9474em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.02</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">万元</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">天</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"推荐系统原理\">推荐系统原理</h3><p>推荐系统是电商平台的&quot;流量发动机&quot;，决定了每个用户在首页、搜索结果和信息流中看到什么内容。</p>\n<p><strong>协同过滤</strong>的核心思想——&quot;和你相似的人喜欢什么，你可能也喜欢&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>u</mi></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow></munder><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>u</mi></msub></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt><mo>⋅</mo><msqrt><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sim}(u, v) = \\frac{\\sum_{i \\in I_{u} \\cap I_{v}} r_{ui} \\cdot r_{vi}}{\\sqrt{\\sum_{i \\in I_u} r_{ui}^2} \\cdot \\sqrt{\\sum_{i \\in I_v} r_{vi}^2}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.2698em;vertical-align:-1.73em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5398em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\